WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.657
Unit fourteen. Coughs and Sneezes!

2
00:00:04.628 --> 00:00:08.286
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:12.186
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.236 --> 00:00:16.167
Today we learn about Coughs and Sneezes. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.320
Cough. Say it with me. Cough!

6
00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:27.002
Sneeze. Say it with me. Sneeze!

7
00:00:30.485 --> 00:00:34.069
Elbow. Say it with me. Elbow!

8
00:00:37.573 --> 00:00:41.057
Tissue. Say it with me. Tissue!

9
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.641
Bin. Say it with me. Bin!

10
00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:54.563
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

11
00:00:58.061 --> 00:01:01.378
Cover. Say it with me. Cover!

12
00:01:04.882 --> 00:01:08.115
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

13
00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:19.569
When I cough or sneeze, I cover my mouth with a tissue or my elbow. I put the tissue in the bin. Then I wash my hands to stop germs.

14
00:01:19.619 --> 00:01:20.863
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:27.510
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.710
Elbow!

17
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:34.802
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.852 --> 00:01:36.002
Cover!

19
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:43.103
Did you know? Tiny drops from a sneeze can travel far, so covering it protects your friends!

20
00:01:43.153 --> 00:01:45.147
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:53.422
Think and answer. What should you cover when you sneeze?

22
00:01:53.472 --> 00:01:54.622
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.728
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.778 --> 00:02:03.429
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

